        "title": "MRR pricing uses pending tier and adds renewal check",
        "summary": "The shared subscription constants in `common` update `freebuffSubscriptionMrrUsd` to price scheduled downgrades at the lower tier that Stripe bills next, using a pending tier field when available. A new `freebuffSubscriptionRenews` helper determines if a live subscription still contributes to MRR by excluding Stripe plans set to cancel at period end, while counting prepaid years. The new `FREEBUFF_MRR_DEFINITION` string documents the exact counting rules for admin dashboard labels, clarifying that grants, past-due accounts, and canceling plans are held out.",
